ing the reinvent and safe keep  programs friday and tuesday classes will  resume again on wednesday january 19th  reporting live madison kimbrough live  local now  madison and in a statement governor  sisilak says he understands parents may  be disappointed but he's also committed  to keeping schools open for in-person  learning
 

